229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Hirevue offers informed consent with a detailed welcome screen that explains what the online interview will entail, whether AI or humans will be reviewing the responses, and how the hiring team will use this recorded video in their final decision. However, even with this informed consent, there is the added pressure and need to not fall behind in the competitive hiring environment. Thus, candidates feel as though they have no choice but to consent to this system. They then worry about how long their data is stored, who has access, and whether it could be used beyond hiring. In 2022, a class action lawsuit was filed because biometric data was allegedly being collected without informed consent, violating the Illinois Biometric Information Privacy Act \(BIPA\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
